+/// The spec 60 §3 TV-side re-init after a wake (the best found: 5 of 6 with the cold state before
+/// the sleep), as the default of the driver's `tvtop_init`: with `clocks`, the boot loader's TV
+/// clock rewrites (each read back otherwise in bit 0 for the two PLL words, so not compared), then
+/// the TV-top sequence (+4, +8, +0; all three 0; the three again; +8 = 0x504 for the ring writes,
+/// 58 §1), each followed by 12 ms.
