+/// The TV-top part of [`TVTOP_REINIT_CLOCKS`] (spec 60 §3, 50 §2).
+pub const TVTOP_REINIT: &str = "0x06e00004=0x01111117,delay=12000,0x06e00008=0x404,delay=12000,\
